<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss money market unchanged, quiet.</title>
<headline>Swiss money market unchanged, quiet.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss money market was quiet on Wednesday with tomorrow/next money quoted at 1-5/8 to 1-3/4 percent, traders said.</p>
<p>The Swiss National Bank was seen in the market adding one-week money at the same rate as recent operations of 1-5/8 percent.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
